    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikengila Jokanan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Jakanan, kere ma Aradi, ma bedo yupiny ma Kanan, owinjo nike Joisiraili oyido jobino gi i royo ma Atharim, go olwenyo gi jo to tero megi paka jotwec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili jokwoŋere ri Rwoth ka jowaco ni, “K'adieri inomiy ji me i cingi wan, walareyo woko jo kicutho kanyacel gi tindin pajo madongo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owinjo dwondi Joisiraili, to miyo Jokanan i cingi Joisiraili ma joreyo woko jo kicutho kanyacel gi tindin pajo madongo. Ameno olwoŋi kabedo no ni Horima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Horima",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Me dhohiburu madwoŋ mere nyutho reyo woko",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thwol m'otimi gi ywel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 2:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili joay wok i got Hor gi i royo ma kidho i Nam M'obokere, kadho thoko lowo ma Edom; to jok'onyalo bedo moth i yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.10.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 10:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili joluwere marac kwoŋ Were kodi Musa ka jopenjo ni, “Raŋo wiwodho wan wok i Misir, kelo wan tho ka i thim kama cemo kodi pi ongoy'iye, aka wadak cemo masisiri me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth odhiro thwole ma jokwir i dier Joisiraili ma jokayo ji, ŋey Joisiraili kweth jotho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili jobino bongi Musa to jowaco rigo ni, “Watieko timo reco gi luwirok kwoŋ Rwoth kodin. Onyo kway Rwoth wokwany woko thwole kwoŋ wan.” Ameno Musa okwayo ri ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Tim thwol ma nyweny manitie gi kwir, t'iŋawo wi yath, aka kisi ŋata thwol okay to ŋiyo bino kwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kerin 18:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 3:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Musa otimo thwol ma ywel, to ketho wi yath, aka kisi ka thwol okayo dhano, ŋato ŋiyo thwol ma ywel to kwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wok i Got Hor kadho i milelo pa Jomowab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili joay kenyo, to joketho kambi i Oboth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowok Obothi aka joketho kambi i Lye Abarim i thim mager gi Mowab yuwok ceŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok kenyo jokadho to joketho kambi i milelo ma Zered. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok kenyo jokadho to joketho kambi i thenge ca ma Arinon manitie i thim ma wok i kew pa Joamor, kole Arinon obedo kew pa Mowab, i dier Jomowab kodi Joamor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno ondikere i Kitawo ma Lweny pa Rwoth ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok kenyo jomedere kiri i Ber, i jwom ma Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Coki ji kanyacel ŋey anyal miyo jo pi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Joisiraili jowero wer me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokowere wok i thim kidho Matana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i Matana jokadho i Nahaliel, aka wok i Nahaliel jokadho i Bamoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i Bamoth jokadho kiri i milelo manitie iy'adec ma Mowab wi got Pisiga ma ŋiyo abar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikengila Kere Sihon kodi Kere Og",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Joisiraili jooro jomikwenda bongi Kere Sihon pa Joamor, ka jowaco ni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Weyi waluw i piny perin, wakilarwayo i ndelin kosa i ndelin ma vini. Wakilamadho pi ma waŋ pi moro je, walaluwo i royo pa kere cuka wanotiek kalo adec perin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Sihon k'onyalo yeyo Joisiraili luwo iy'adec pere. Sihon ocoko ji pere je kanyacel to kadho romo gi Joisiraili i thim. Sihon obino i Yahaz lweny gi Joisiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili joneko jo, aka jomayo Sihon lowo pere wok i Arinon tundo i Yabok, bor kiri Amon, kole kew pa Joamon oyido ikuro matek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili jotero tindin me je, aka jobedo i tindin pa Joamor, i Hesibon kodi i calin mere je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato Hesibon oyido obedo tindi madwoŋ pa Kere Sihon pa Joamor, macon mere olwenyo gi kere ma Mowab to mako lowo pere je tundo kiri Arinon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:27"
